# The webfonts are not just binary, they are load-bearing binary:
# src/memai/roboto_metrics.json is a width table extracted from these exact
# files, and diagram_svg wraps text against it. A byte that changes on the
# way through git -- an eol filter that decides a woff2 looks like text --
# would not fail loudly; it would make the SVG renderer break a line where
# the canvas does not. Say it explicitly rather than trust autodetection.
*.woff2 binary
*.safetensors binary
